<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memento Pattern Integrat=
ion:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>State capture</strong>:=
 memento captures editor state before command execution</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>State restoration</stro=
ng>: undo operation restores previous state</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Encapsulation</strong>:=
 memento hides internal state representation</li>
</ul>
